===Etymology 1===
Alteration of {{m|en|-oma}}, from {{bor|en|grc|-ωμα}}.

Only partially cognate to {{m|en|-some||body}}, from {{m|grc|σῶμα||body}}, in that both share the case ending {{m|grc|-μα}}, but the ω is unrelated.

====Suffix====
{{en-suffix}}

# A [[mass]] of something.

